    ["xi25.y", "xi26.b", "en_pdb", "control"],
    ["xi26.y", "PORT.en_pu", "en_pu", "control"]
   ],
   "controls": {
    "zq_start": "start (st_go = start pulse & ~busy)",
    "rstb": "async reset of all flops"
   },
   "notes": "Prescaler xi0..xi2 is a 3b ripple counter on zq_clk; step_clk = q2b buffered (one step = 8 zq_clk); cmp_clk = q2&q1&q0&busy (last zq_clk of every step). Sequencer w0->w1->tu<5>..tu<0>->td<5>..td<0> is a shift register clocked by step_clk with a single token injected by st_go. busy = (busy|st_go)&~td<0>; done = (done|td<0>)&~st_go. en_pd = OR(td<5:0>); en_pu = busy & ~en_pd. Feedback loops on busy and done flops. [direct primitives in this cell: 2 MOS]"
  },
  "zq_sar6": {
